{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/gallery.dart:offset-91787", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/gallery.dart", "location": "offset-91787", "text": "'This one carries a real loop, a heart-rate dropout and a '\n'named top set — the awkward cases the goldens shoot.'", "sha256": "2f5e329a1c1ef21be7bf92f7046201c78404eed73a299e76ce5fefb5213e13c1", "kind": "dart", "start": 91787, "end": 91925, "line": 2345}
