{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/gestures.dart:offset-3281", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/gestures.dart", "location": "offset-3281", "text": "'Tap the band twice'", "sha256": "c8a5dfa1015a9cf400101126da20f8a8af1260da9961bcc7c5fbfe446d9a7740", "kind": "dart", "start": 3281, "end": 3301, "line": 88}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/gestures.dart:offset-3437", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/gestures.dart", "location": "offset-3437", "text": "'Only while the app is connected and awake. A tap the '\n'band stored while your phone was away arrives later with '\n'an old timestamp, and is ignored rather than fired hours '\n'after you meant it.'", "sha256": "bbf0625f7c8a13814720cbc261ae0a5e338f4ed91d40974c140ae2b2bffbcd5e", "kind": "dart", "start": 3437, "end": 3724, "line": 92}
