{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/pair_sensor.dart:offset-11442", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/pair_sensor.dart", "location": "offset-11442", "text": "'Pair another'", "sha256": "f90d8ba151d8bc33b89bab512384701c8ae580b87c95c2ab793a34c02e5a1636", "kind": "dart", "start": 11442, "end": 11456, "line": 295}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/pair_sensor.dart:offset-11593", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/pair_sensor.dart", "location": "offset-11593", "text": "'A sensor is used only while a workout is running, and '\n'only for heart rate and beat timing. It does not '\n'replace your band, it is never used overnight, and '\n'nothing it records feeds a score yet — its readings are '\n'stored and shown, and that is all.'", "sha256": "a8d8748639e61a6c2dbc644b25b9a05208f17ef5f1d83f20cf5a6de574bbee6b", "kind": "dart", "start": 11593, "end": 11971, "line": 299}
