{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-6170", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-6170", "text": "'$storeName did not grant those readings. Nothing was read.'", "sha256": "a0d3bbb070a14a0b11b1223d2b7b85d66e28e4c3d217d1197cd950294b0ed8b7", "kind": "dart", "start": 6170, "end": 6230, "line": 167}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-6400", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-6400", "text": "'Nothing came back. $storeName holds no readings of these kinds, '\n'or none inside the window it will share.'", "sha256": "eafe4881e7095dc35f2acf8e8aeefe97c234e6fcdd2bf4266ae7d7ef6ff18a88", "kind": "dart", "start": 6400, "end": 6529, "line": 175}
