{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-7227", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-7227", "text": "'From your phone'", "sha256": "44af48304c4e62f28be873a49776193869254a8f42ceb05535fb01187b6651bf", "kind": "dart", "start": 7227, "end": 7244, "line": 201}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-7574", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-7574", "text": "'Resting heart rate'", "sha256": "8109f61a2ba69dd70f43fd8f6773ad54824d10b44e2393208cecbcb21003e97d", "kind": "dart", "start": 7574, "end": 7594, "line": 209}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-7901", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-7901", "text": "'Reads your resting heart rate from $storeName, so '\n'the app has a rough idea of your normal before the '\n'band has measured one.'", "sha256": "a3b08bd283691c161e4b5e459548657f41cf17689e79d041550e67ba5a82e6db", "kind": "dart", "start": 7901, "end": 8104, "line": 216}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-8857", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-8857", "text": "'Nothing uses it yet. It waits until the band has '\n'measured 14 of its own nights, then gets compared '\n'against them below. It never becomes a reading of '\n'its own: no night on the sleep chart, no day with '\n'a score.'", "sha256": "f2ec5a10a8191b2ef7327fb036404613c86abccfe8005cbdb47bef812177bc3c", "kind": "dart", "start": 8857, "end": 9222, "line": 230}
