{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-12751", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-12751", "text": "'Over ${cmp.bandNights} nights the band lands within '\n'${cmp.deltaBpm.abs().toStringAsFixed(1)} bpm of '\n'what $storeName said. It still is not used for '\n'anything.'", "sha256": "4936b86d1dfbfba6c4ea9a25242804197db22f585dbf1840a8b34cf1ef51f7c6", "kind": "dart", "start": 12751, "end": 13020, "line": 299}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-13422", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-13422", "text": "'Measured by something else'", "sha256": "ddc16479329a2fb42456c178eca194f691be8bce9524c790ab96b25266609108", "kind": "dart", "start": 13422, "end": 13450, "line": 311}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-13755", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-13755", "text": "'A cuff, a glucose meter, a thermometer. This band '\n'cannot measure any of them, which is the entire '\n'reason they are worth showing — and why the app '\n'that recorded each reading is named beside it.'", "sha256": "4011ccf3c44a82466e39327d84199a823e4df4aa56d1a1a9052d7e91de7a7e62", "kind": "dart", "start": 13755, "end": 14066, "line": 318}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart:offset-14356", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/phone_import.dart", "location": "offset-14356", "text": "'Shown as they arrived. Never averaged into one of '\n'this app’s own numbers, never used to teach it to '\n'guess one from the wrist.'", "sha256": "c5992aaf5e73909221cedd3a5602becd06ca2c22b9387792199dffe4fb24e204", "kind": "dart", "start": 14356, "end": 14561, "line": 327}
